        "Dasha Vestibule Campaign Nightfall Region Vabbi Type Mission outpost Party size 8 Exit(s) The Hidden City of AhdashimThe Mirror of Lyss Images Entrance location when it remains hidden View from outside, right next to the Resurrection Shrine From the Mirror of Lyss, once it's unlocked",
        "Dasha Vestibule is the hidden entrance to the secret refuge of the Princes of Vabbi. It is rumored to hold fabulous riches that are protected by deadly guardians."
