    {
      "heading": "Getting there",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "If you previously chose to follow Margrid the Sly, the primary quest Greed and Regret will conclude in this outpost.",
        "If you chose to follow the Master of Whispers instead, it is still possible to gain entry, but only after completion of the primary quest Calling the Order. Head northwest out of Honur Hill in The Mirror of Lyss towards the second closest Resurrection Shrine. Watch the wall; it will crumble as you near it, revealing the entrance to this outpost. It is to the right of this Resurrection Shrine.",
        "Also the secondary quest Goren's Stuff: Part 2 leads characters through this outpost."
      ]
    },
