    {
      "heading": "Notes",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "The world map may mark this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the Dasha Vestibule mission or Dzagonur Bastion mission, which is Greed and Regret or Calling the Order. This outpost and the associated Hidden City of Ahdashim do not contribute to the Elonian Cartographer because they are underground, and do not appear on the World Map.",
        "Towns and outposts in Vabbi The Kodash Bazaar • Basalt Grotto • Chantry of Secrets • Dasha Vestibule • Dzagonur Bastion • Grand Court of Sebelkeh • Honur Hill • Jennur's Horde • Mihanu Township • Tihark Orchard • Yahnur Market Missions • Explorable areas • Landmarks"
