  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Dasha_Vestibule\" title=\"Dasha Vestibule\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Dasha_Vestibule_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Dasha Vestibule (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Dasha Vestibule\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dasha_Vestibule.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dasha Vestibule.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/6c/Dasha_Vestibule.jpg/196px-Dasha_Vestibule.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/6/6c/Dasha_Vestibule.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi\" title=\"Vabbi\">Vabbi</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hidden_City_of_Ahdashim\" title=\"The Hidden City of Ahdashim\">The Hidden City of Ahdashim</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">The Mirror of Lyss</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Location_of_Dasha_Vestibule_entrance.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Location of Dasha Vestibule entrance.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/72/Location_of_Dasha_Vestibule_entrance.jpg/200px-Location_of_Dasha_Vestibule_entrance.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"304\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/72/Location_of_Dasha_Vestibule_entrance.jpg/300px-Location_of_Dasha_Vestibule_entrance.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/72/Location_of_Dasha_Vestibule_entrance.jpg/400px-Location_of_Dasha_Vestibule_entrance.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1120\" data-file-height=\"1701\" /></a><br /><small>Entrance location when it remains hidden</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dasha_Vestibule_wall_hidden.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dasha Vestibule wall hidden.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/47/Dasha_Vestibule_wall_hidden.jpg/196px-Dasha_Vestibule_wall_hidden.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"107\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/47/Dasha_Vestibule_wall_hidden.jpg/294px-Dasha_Vestibule_wall_hidden.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/47/Dasha_Vestibule_wall_hidden.jpg/392px-Dasha_Vestibule_wall_hidden.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"2555\" data-file-height=\"1389\" /></a><br /><small>View from outside, right next to the <a href=\"/wiki/Resurrection_Shrine\" title=\"Resurrection Shrine\">Resurrection Shrine</a></small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dasha_Vestibule_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dasha Vestibule world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/7c/Dasha_Vestibule_world_map.jpg/200px-Dasha_Vestibule_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"304\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/7c/Dasha_Vestibule_world_map.jpg/300px-Dasha_Vestibule_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/7c/Dasha_Vestibule_world_map.jpg/400px-Dasha_Vestibule_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1120\" data-file-height=\"1701\" /></a><br /><small>From <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">the Mirror of Lyss</a>, once it's unlocked</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>The Vestibule is the main entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hidden_City_of_Ahdashim\" title=\"The Hidden City of Ahdashim\">the Hidden City of Ahdashim</a> and serves its role well. Soaring and opulently appointed, only the <a href=\"/wiki/Princes_of_Vabbi\" title=\"Princes of Vabbi\">princes of Vabbi</a> usually gaze upon its splendor.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Dasha Vestibule</b> is the hidden entrance to the secret refuge of the <a href=\"/wiki/Prince_of_Vabbi\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prince of Vabbi\">Princes of Vabbi</a>. It is rumored to hold fabulous riches that are protected by deadly guardians.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dasha_Vestibule_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If you previously chose to follow <a href=\"/wiki/Margrid_the_Sly\" title=\"Margrid the Sly\">Margrid the Sly</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Greed_and_Regret\" title=\"Greed and Regret\">Greed and Regret</a> will conclude in this outpost.\n</p><p>If you chose to follow the <a href=\"/wiki/Master_of_Whispers\" title=\"Master of Whispers\">Master of Whispers</a> instead, it is still possible to gain entry, but only after completion of the primary quest <a href=\"/wiki/Calling_the_Order\" title=\"Calling the Order\">Calling the Order</a>. Head northwest out of <a href=\"/wiki/Honur_Hill\" title=\"Honur Hill\">Honur Hill</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">The Mirror of Lyss</a> towards the second closest <a href=\"/wiki/Resurrection_Shrine\" title=\"Resurrection Shrine\">Resurrection Shrine</a>. Watch the wall; it will crumble as you near it, revealing the entrance to this outpost. It is to the right of this Resurrection Shrine.\n</p><p>Also the secondary quest <a href=\"/wiki/Goren%27s_Stuff:_Part_2\" title=\"Goren&#39;s Stuff: Part 2\">Goren's Stuff: Part 2</a> leads characters through this outpost.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dasha_Vestibule_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hidden_City_of_Ahdashim\" title=\"The Hidden City of Ahdashim\">The Hidden City of Ahdashim</a> (north)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mirror_of_Lyss\" title=\"The Mirror of Lyss\">The Mirror of Lyss</a> (south)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dasha_Vestibule_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dasha_Vestibule_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dasha_Vestibule_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Peshwan\" title=\"Peshwan\">Peshwan</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchant</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Agent\" title=\"Xunlai Agent\">Xunlai Agent</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage_upgrades\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage upgrades\">storage upgrades</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Henc