r\" title=\"Vabbian Miner\">Vabbian Miner</a> (does not always spawn)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Vabbian_Child\" title=\"Vabbian Child\">Vabbian Child</a>  (does not always spawn)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dasha_Vestibule_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Gallery\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:27px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dasha_Vestibule_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"A view inside\"><img alt=\"A view inside\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/61/Dasha_Vestibule_inside.jpg/120px-Dasha_Vestibule_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"96\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/61/Dasha_Vestibule_inside.jpg/180px-Dasha_Vestibule_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/61/Dasha_Vestibule_inside.jpg/240px-Dasha_Vestibule_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>A view inside\n</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Dasha_Vestibule_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/World_map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"World map\">world map</a> may mark this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the <a href=\"/wiki/Dasha_Vestibule\" title=\"Dasha Vestibule\">Dasha Vestibule mission</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dzagonur_Bastion\" title=\"Dzagonur Bastion\">Dzagonur Bastion mission</a>, which is <a href=\"/wiki/Greed_and_Regret\" title=\"Greed and Regret\">Greed and Regret</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Calling_the_Order\" title=\"Calling the Order\">Calling the Order</a>.</li>\n<li>This outpost and the associated <a href=\"/wiki/Hidden_City_of_Ahdashim\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hidden City of Ahdashim\">Hidden City of Ahdashim</a> do not contribute to the <a href=\"/wiki/Elonian_Cartographer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elonian Cartographer\">Elonian Cartographer</a> because they are underground, and do not appear on the <a href=\"/wiki/World_Map\" title=\"World Map\">World Map</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vabbi#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"Vabbi\">Towns and outposts in Vabbi</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Kodash_Bazaar\" title=\"The Kodash Bazaar\">The Kodash Bazaar</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basalt_Grotto\" title=\"Basalt Grotto\">Basalt Grotto</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chantry_of_Secrets\" title=\"Chantry of Secrets\">Chantry of Secrets</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dasha Vestibule</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dzagonur_Bastion_(outpost)\" title=\"Dzagonur Bastion (outpost)\">Dzagonur Bastion</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/